   "t": 0,
   "text": "Want players taking people on again? Pay them double for it.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "A small pitch with small goals, and one rule that changes everything.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 4.16,
   "text": "A goal after a successful take-on counts double, so beating someone pays.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 8.33,
   "text": "Losing it while trying is never criticised. That's the deal, and you keep it.",
